/** @mainpage

This suite exercises tsf-data - dataset validation on the Test Agent
where the data lives - against fixtures whose defects are known exactly.

The fixtures and the oracle are written on the agent by lib/py/datagen.py
with the Python standard library (csv, json, statistics, sqlite3) and,
when installed, pyarrow: independent implementations of every format and
statistic the module computes. A test asserts tsf-data reports exactly
the defects the generator planted and exactly the statistics Python
computed. Numeric results go out as MI measurement artifacts, so the HTML
log and Bublik draw them as graphs.

*/
